@startuml
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor white
title Alternativa B (descartada): CitaSalud Arequipa con microservicios
actor "Paciente / Médico" as U
node "API Gateway" as GW
package "Microservicios" {
  [Auth y Usuarios] as C
  [Disponibilidad] as P
  [Reservas de Citas] as PA
  [Notificaciones] as N
  [Médicos y Horarios] as R
}
queue "Broker de eventos\n(RabbitMQ)" as MQ
database "BD Auth" as DB1
database "BD Disponibilidad" as DB2
database "BD Reservas" as DB3
cloud "Pasarela Yape / Plin" as Y
cloud "WhatsApp API" as W
U --> GW
GW --> C
GW --> P
GW --> PA
GW --> N
GW --> R
C --> DB1
P --> DB2
PA --> DB3
PA ..> MQ : CitaCreada
MQ ..> N
N --> W
PA --> Y
note bottom of MQ
Mayor escalabilidad independiente,
pero +5 despliegues, +3 BD, broker,
monitoreo distribuido: costo alto
para un equipo de 5 developers.
end note
@enduml